From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: each display draws with its own gamma ramp

A night light per display and wlr-gamma-control clients (gammastep,
wl-gammarelay-rs) need a ramp per CRTC, at the CRTC's size.

- CreateDisplaySnapshot reads the CRTC's GAMMA_LUT_SIZE, or its legacy
  ramp size, into DisplaySnapshot::domicile_gamma_size. 0 means no
  gamma, as on a DisplayLink dock. The snapshot's mojom carries it, and
  Clone() keeps it.
- OzonePlatform::GetDomicileGammaSizes lends DrmScreen's sizes to the
  browser, as GetDomicileConnectors does the connectors.
- SetDomicileGamma(display_id, ramp) replaces SetDomicileWhitePoint:
  DrmModeset keeps each display's ramp and sets it again after each
  confirmed modeset. Every other platform ignores it.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
